### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health


### Create Analysis Request - single photo (complexity=0, instant)
# Expected: 201, status=pending. Poll GET below until status=success.
# Result should be: age=29, primary_generation=y, checksum=0x1d
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analysis/7635bd23-ced9-4f6f-9fae-afe52625d699/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "b6a6671c-f04c-47f8-a4d3-11374f0d75cb",
  "urgent": false,
  "photos": ["MHwyOXwwfDB8MHw2MHw0MHwwfE1pbGxpZSB0aGUgbGFzdCBvZiB0aGUgbWlsbGVubmlhbHMuIA=="]
}

### Create Analysis Request - multiple photos age=22 z=100, age=28 y=50 z=50 expect checksum=0x32
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analysis/7635bd23-ced9-4f6f-9fae-afe52625d699/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "b6a6671c-f04c-47f8-a4d3-11374f0d75cb",
  "urgent": false,
  "photos": ["MHwyMnwwfDB8MHwwfDEwMHwwfGFiY2Rl", "MHwyOHwwfDB8MHw1MHw1MHwwfGFiY2Rl"]
}


