### Get Request by ID - paste the id from a POST response here (expect 200, pending -> success)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analysis/7635bd23-ced9-4f6f-9fae-afe52625d699/requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### Get Request by ID - valid UUIDs but request belongs to a different customer (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analysis/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### Get Request by ID - invalid customer_id (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analysis/not-a-uuid/requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### Get Request by ID - invalid request_id (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analysis/7635bd23-ced9-4f6f-9fae-afe52625d699/requests/not-a-uuid


### Get Request by ID - unknown request_id (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analysis/7635bd23-ced9-4f6f-9fae-afe52625d699/requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


